- Can you review the website and pick six most important user journeys from the
site?

# Sign up / Create new user acount
1. Click `Signup / Login` on the navigation bar
2. Fill in `Name` and `Email Address` fields > Click `Signup` button
   > make sure invalid email address format or invalid names are unable to proceed
3. Enter all the account and address information
   > make sure the process can't be proceeded when any required field is missing 
4. Click `Create Account` button
5. Verify account is created and is logged in


# Login
1. Click `Signup / Login` on the navigation bar
2. Enter `Email Address` and `Password` > Click `Login` button
3. Verify the account is logged in


# Product discovery
1. Go to `Home` or `Products` page
<By cateogy filter>
2a. Category section > Click on each category > Click on each subcategory > Verify the products appeared match with the category filter
<By brand filter>
2b. Brand sections > Click on each brand > Verify the products appeared match the brand filter and the product count matches as well
<By search keywords>
2c. Enter search keywords in search bar > Click magnigier button to procees > Verify the products being filtered are contextual 
    Enter meaningless input in search bar > Verify no products should show up
3. Click `+ View Product` button on each product thumbnail > Verify product details are shown


# Complete an order
1. Log in > browse through the product page
2a. Move cursor to the image of the product thumbnail > Click `Add to cart` button to add product to the cart
2b. Click `+ View Product` button on any product thumbnail > Set the required quantity > Click `Add to cart` button
    Make sure invalid quantity, e.g. decimal, negative value, zero, is not allowed to proceed
3. Click `Continue Shopping` on the prompt > Add all products desired to the cart
4. Click `View cart` on the prompt > you should be redirected to the cart page
5. Check the items added > Click `Proceed To Checkout`
6. Verify Delivery Address and Billing Address are correct
7. Review the order and scroll down > click `Place Order` 
8. Enter card details > Make sure missing fields are not allowed to proceed > Verify invalid input of any field is not allowed to proceed
9. Click `Pay and Confirm Order` > Verify the order is placed successfully


# Cart Management
1. Have some products added to the cart
2. Click `Cart` on the navigation bar > Check the item added and quantity match with your choice
3. Click on the number in Quantity column > Verify you can modify the quantity
4. Verify you can remove item from the cart by clicking the X button at the end of the row
5. Verify the amount in Price and Total columns matches with that on product page


# Guest-to-account checkout path
1. Don't sign up/log in yet
2. Go to Product page > Add some products to the cart > View Cart
3. Click `Proceed To Checkout` button > Click `Register / Login` on the prompt
4. Enter your account information > Login
5. Verify you are returned to the checkout page 
6. Verify the content in the cart are preserved 
7. Continue the checkout process > Make sure the order can be placed

